@*
    Light/dark toggle. Flips <html data-theme>, persists to localStorage, and (for signed-in
    users) PUTs the choice to /api/preferences so it's stored server-side and follows the user
    across machines. Plain DOM onclick — no Blazor interop, works pre- and post-hydration. The
    init script in App.razor applies the resolved theme before first paint; icons swap via CSS
    on [data-theme] (see klassd.css .theme-toggle). The fetch is fire-and-forget: it succeeds
    when authenticated and is harmlessly rejected (401) on the anonymous login page.
*@
<button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-circle theme-toggle" title="Toggle light / dark"
        aria-label="Toggle light / dark theme"
        onclick="(function(){var d=document.documentElement,t=d.getAttribute('data-theme')==='dark'?'light':'dark';d.setAttribute('data-theme',t);try{localStorage.setItem('klassd-theme',t);}catch(e){}try{fetch('/api/preferences',{method:'PUT',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({theme:t})});}catch(e){}})()">
    <svg class="icon-sun" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
         fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" />
        <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41" />
    </svg>
    <svg class="icon-moon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
         fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z" />
    </svg>
</button>
